{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery of Night Order\u00a0</strong>is an arcade-style 2D action game focused on boss battles. As you climb the mysterious and silent <strong>Moon Spire</strong>, you'll become <strong>the</strong> <strong>Night Lord,</strong>\u00a0and uncover the secrets of the tower and your own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/extras/052dcab1a2ac877307763b74a2123678.poster.avif?t=1757544177\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/extras/052dcab1a2ac877307763b74a2123678.apng?t=1757544177\" class=\"bb_img\" width=350 height=175 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Moon Spire and the Gallery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tWaking up without past memory, the protagonist is instinctively drawn to the Moon Spire. The rule of the spire's gallery is to meet challengers within the world of its paintings. Find out for yourself what awaits you at the top of the spire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/extras/86791aaf7818c8fe9a2d25c4b5d3bf05.poster.avif?t=1757544177\" width=350 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/extras/86791aaf7818c8fe9a2d25c4b5d3bf05.webm?t=1757544177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/extras/86791aaf7818c8fe9a2d25c4b5d3bf05.mp4?t=1757544177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe combat is designed traditionally yet solid. Look for opportunities by dodging and blocking, then counter with combos and skills. You can customize your strategy with rings, skills, and items. A variety of enemies await your challenge, from duels against human-scale foes to battles against gigantic monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple yet dynamic pixel art conveys the core excitement of an action game. Experience the cute yet cool protagonist, the unique residents of the tower, the silent, desolate tower, and the vivid worlds inside the paintings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/extras/6235a6d6f3a5ab7797a6595c400f26c9.poster.avif?t=1757544177\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/extras/6235a6d6f3a5ab7797a6595c400f26c9.apng?t=1757544177\" class=\"bb_img\" width=350 height=175 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong><br>Climb the tower step by step while experiencing the unfolding story.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong><br>A challenging mode inspired by classic games, featuring a mix of random elements and consecutive battles. Reach the top of the tower and uncover its secrets!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery Tour Mode</strong><br>Freely challenge the gallery at your own pace. Explore its halls to discover hidden items and unexpected intruders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>...Are you ready to face your past?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf19</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack: BGMemon</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960990?t=1757544177","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960990?t=1757544177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/208dd41f6818e9d6d7543092607caa16e5e18906/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757544177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/208dd41f6818e9d6d7543092607caa16e5e18906/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757544177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery of Night Order\u00a0</strong>is an arcade-style 2D action game focused on boss battles. As you climb the mysterious and silent <strong>Moon Spire</strong>, you'll become <strong>the</strong> <strong>Night Lord,</strong>\u00a0and uncover the secrets of the tower and your own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/extras/052dcab1a2ac877307763b74a2123678.poster.avif?t=1757544177\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960990/extras/052dcab1a2ac877307763b74a2123678.apng?t=1757544177\" class=\"bb_img\" width=350 height=175 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Moon Spire and the Gallery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tWaking up without past memory, the protagonist is instinctively drawn to the Moon Spire. The 